From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Burke Cates <burke.cates@gmail.com>
Date: Sat, 24 Oct 2026 13:31:37 -0700
Subject: [PATCH] NOT-FOR-UPSTREAM: arm64: dts: qcom: glymur-asus-zenbook-a16: Allow setting the
 RTC time

rtc-qcom-glink reads and sets the firmware's RTC through the
firmware's GIO time interface and writes UTC with a zero time zone
offset, which reads back as UTC. Allow it to set the time, so that the
NTP sync keeps the RTC correct.

Assisted-by: Claude:claude-opus-5-5
---
Not-for-upstream: local workaround for one laptop, not reviewed for
  submission; use only for local testing.

 arch/arm64/boot/dts/qcom/glymur-asus-zenbook-a16-ux3607oa.dts | 1 +
 1 file changed, 1 insertion(+)

diff --git a/arch/arm64/boot/dts/qcom/glymur-asus-zenbook-a16-ux3607oa.dts b/arch/arm64/boot/dts/qcom/glymur-asus-zenbook-a16-ux3607oa.dts
index 939e1a9..dbbfd6f 100644
--- a/arch/arm64/boot/dts/qcom/glymur-asus-zenbook-a16-ux3607oa.dts
+++ b/arch/arm64/boot/dts/qcom/glymur-asus-zenbook-a16-ux3607oa.dts
@@ -150,6 +150,7 @@
 			     "qcom,pmic-glink";
 		#address-cells = <1>;
 		#size-cells = <0>;
+		allow-set-time;
 
 		/* Left side display-adjacent port */
 		connector@0 {
-- 
